00:25:46.550 --> 00:25:48.440
Diba sabi ko sayo kontakin mo ako?

00:25:49.830 --> 00:25:51.680
Sinabi mo na mayroon kang koneksyon.

00:25:51.680 --> 00:25:53.350
Who knows kung nagyayabang ka lang?

00:25:53.350 --> 00:25:54.150
Kung alam kong totoo ang iyong koneksyon,

00:25:54.150 --> 00:25:55.610
Kokontakin sana kita.

00:25:56.140 --> 00:25:58.410
Hindi ko inaasahan na makikita kita dito.

00:25:58.510 --> 00:25:59.680
Ito ay dapat na kapalaran.

00:25:59.680 --> 00:26:00.790
Oo. Cheers.

